Package: mm-ofono
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, modemmanager, ofono
Provides: ofono2mm
Conflicts: ofono2mm
Replaces: ofono2mm
Description: ModemManager D-Bus API on top of oFono
 Exposes org.freedesktop.ModemManager1 on top of oFono, so ModemManager
 clients (NetworkManager, Phosh, GNOME Calls, Chatty, GNOME Settings) work
 on Halium/Droidian devices whose modem is driven by oFono + ofono-binder.
 .
 Runs as ModemManager.service in place of ModemManager itself and replaces
 the Python ofono2mm.
